/*
 * Retrieves and installs ancestor vtable entries into the current class vtable.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - copying ancestor method prototypes into the child vtable,
 *   - adjusting protection levels for inherited private methods,
 *   - copying ancestor template methods and their protections,
 *   - propagating ancestor-implemented traits,
 *   - initializing methodsToValidate for inherited entries.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::method::ancestor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/method/ancestor.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-29
